  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Digital Governance and Fight against Organised Crime</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of the Action (EUR 6 000 000) is twofold: The first is to contribute to the achievement of the current Strategy to Combat Illicit Trafficking and Control of the Expansion of Coca Crops through two projects, one on Supporting the Bolivian National Strategy against Drug Trafficking; and the second to support the implementation of the GAFILAT recommendations resulting from the FATF Mutual Evaluation Report for Bolivia (2024) and the National Strategy against Money Laundering and Terrorist Financing 2023-2025. The second is to improve the efficacy, efficiency and control of the Justice processes through Bolivia&#xBF;s &#xBF;Justicia Libre&#xBF; digital application.</narrative>
  </description>
